IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STUDENT-MARKSHEET.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(20).
01 MARK1 PIC 9(3).
01 MARK2 PIC 9(3).
01 MARK3 PIC 9(3).
01 TOTAL-MARKS PIC 9(3).
01 AVERAGE-MARKS PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT PIC X(4).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "ENTER STUDENT NAME:"
    ACCEPT STUDENT-NAME

    DISPLAY "ENTER THREE SUBJECT MARKS:"
    ACCEPT MARK1
    ACCEPT MARK2
    ACCEPT MARK3

    PERFORM CALCULATE-MARKS

    DISPLAY "STUDENT NAME: " STUDENT-NAME
    DISPLAY "TOTAL MARKS: " TOTAL-MARKS
    DISPLAY "AVERAGE: " AVERAGE-MARKS
    DISPLAY "RESULT: " RESULT

    STOP RUN.

CALCULATE-MARKS.
    COMPUTE TOTAL-MARKS = MARK1 + MARK2 + MARK3
    COMPUTE AVERAGE-MARKS = TOTAL-MARKS / 3

    IF MARK1 >= 50 AND MARK2 >= 50 AND MARK3 >= 50
        MOVE "PASS" TO RESULT
    ELSE
        MOVE "FAIL" TO RESULT
    END-IF.
